--------------------------------
fused_adamw_amsgrad (重载1 - scalar lr)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/fused_adamw_amsgrad_impl.cuh
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    _fused_adamw_amsgrad_cuda_impl_(
        params: TensorList[N],
        grads: TensorList[N],
        exp_avgs: TensorList[N],
        exp_avg_sqs: TensorList[N],
        max_exp_avg_sqs: TensorList[N],
        state_steps: TensorList[N],
        lr: float,
        beta1: float,
        beta2: float,
        weight_decay: float,
        eps: float,
        maximize: bool,
        grad_scale: Optional[Tensor],
        found_inf: Optional[Tensor]
    )

    约束:
    - params, grads, exp_avgs, exp_avg_sqs, max_exp_avg_sqs, state_steps 长度相同


--------------------------------
fused_adamw_amsgrad (重载2 - tensor lr)
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/fused_adamw_amsgrad_impl.cuh
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    _fused_adamw_amsgrad_cuda_impl_(
        params: TensorList[N],
        grads: TensorList[N],
        exp_avgs: TensorList[N],
        exp_avg_sqs: TensorList[N],
        max_exp_avg_sqs: TensorList[N],
        state_steps: TensorList[N],
        lr: Tensor,
        beta1: float,
        beta2: float,
        weight_decay: float,
        eps: float,
        maximize: bool,
        grad_scale: Optional[Tensor],
        found_inf: Optional[Tensor]
    )

    约束:
    - params, grads, exp_avgs, exp_avg_sqs, max_exp_avg_sqs, state_steps 长度相同

【备注】
    - 两个重载的区别: lr 参数类型 (double vs Tensor)
    - AMSGrad 变体: 使用 max_exp_avg_sqs 跟踪二阶动量的最大值
    - 实现细节在对应的 .cu 文件中
